{
 "id": "lem-weil-pbc-direct-image-preserves-injectives",
 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Direct image preserves injectives",
 "statement": "For every morphism $u:U\\to V$, the functor $u_*$ sends injective etale sheaves\nto injective etale sheaves. The relevant adjunction is $u^{-1}\\dashv u_*$, and\n$u^{-1}$ is exact.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-proper-base-change/sk-thm-reduction/lem-weil-pbc-direct-image-preserves-injectives.md",
  "place": "node lem-weil-pbc-direct-image-preserves-injectives, order 1185"
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
  "def-weil-pbc-direct-image",
  "def-weil-pbc-inverse-image"
 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "By the elementary criterion for injective objects ([lem-sp-right-adjoint-preserves-injectives]), a right adjoint to an exact\nfunctor preserves injectives; the exact functor is $u^{-1}$ and the right\nadjoint is $u_*$.",
   "uses": [
    "lem-sp-right-adjoint-preserves-injectives"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
